<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>VirtualCard — Create Your Own Virtual QR Business Card</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Instant personal subdomain, Liquid Glass digital business card, and print-ready 2048px QR code.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/glass.css">
  <style>
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, var(--accent) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .claim-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: rgba(12, 14, 22, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      max-width: 540px;
    }

    .claim-input-wrap {
      flex: 1 1 220px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 0.75rem;
      min-height: 46px;
    }

    .claim-input {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      width: 100%;
      outline: none;
    }

    .claim-domain-suffix {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/bg') %>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <main class="page-container">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-grid">
      <div class="glass-enter delay-1">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <span class="glass-badge">
            <span class="glass-badge-dot"></span>
            Instant Subdomain • Liquid Glass UI
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="hero-title">Create your own virtual QR business card</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 540px;">
          Claim your dedicated subdomain at <strong style="color: var(--text-main);">yourname.<%= baseDomain %></strong>.
          Share a tactile glassmorphic card, high-resolution 2048px QR code, and one-tap contact saving in seconds.
        </p>

        <!-- Subdomain Quick Claim Form (works cleanly with or without JS) -->
        <form action="/signup" method="GET" class="claim-bar" aria-label="Claim your username">
          <div class="claim-input-wrap">
            <input
              type="text"
              name="u"
              class="claim-input"
              placeholder="yourname"
              pattern="[a-z0-9-]{3,30}"
              aria-label="Desired username"
              autocomplete="off"
              autocapitalize="none"
            >
            <span class="claim-domain-suffix">.<%= baseDomain %></span>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="glass-pill glass-btn-primary">
            Claim Card
            <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </button>
        </form>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.35rem; align-items: center;">
          <a href="/signup" class="glass-pill glass-btn-secondary">Start Creating Free</a>
          <a href="/login" style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.925rem; font-weight: 500;">
            Already have a card? <span style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">Log In</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Centerpiece: Floating Interactive Glass Card -->
      <div class="glass-enter delay-2" style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <div class="vcard-preview-card" id="hero-tilt-card">
          <div class="vcard-avatar-wrap">
            <img class="vcard-avatar-img" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='g' x1='0%25' y1='0%25' x2='100%25' y2='100%25'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%2338bdf8'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%231e3a8a'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' fill='url(%23g)'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='50' cy='38' r='18' fill='%23ffffff'/%3E%3Cpath d='M25 80c0-14 11-24 25-24s25 10 25 24' fill='%23ffffff'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Sample profile avatar">
          </div>
          <h2 class="vcard-name">Mahbub Khan</h2>
          <div class="vcard-role">Principal Systems Architect</div>
          <div class="vcard-company">Apex Cloud Infrastructure</div>
          <div class="vcard-tagline">Designing resilient systems &amp; frictionless digital identity</div>

          <div class="vcard-actions">
            <span class="glass-pill glass-btn-primary" style="justify-content: center;">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
              Call • Save Contact
            </span>
            <span class="glass-pill glass-btn-secondary" style="justify-content: center;">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
              mahbub@example.com
            </span>
          </div>

          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
            mahbubkhan.<%= baseDomain %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Feature Glass Tiles -->
    <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="Platform Features">
      <article class="glass-panel glass-panel-interactive glass-enter delay-2">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Instant Subdomain</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Your card goes live instantly at <code>username.<%= baseDomain %></code> with automatic TLS encryption.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="glass-panel glass-panel-interactive glass-enter delay-3">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect width="5" height="5" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="5" height="5" x="16" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="5" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"/><path d="M21 16h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3"/><path d="M21 21v.01"/><path d="M12 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7"/><path d="M3 12h.01"/><path d="M12 3h.01"/><path d="M12 16v.01"/><path d="M16 12h1"/><path d="M21 12v.01"/><path d="M12 21v-1"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2048px Print-Ready QR</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Error-correction H high-contrast PNG (2048×2048) and vector SVG downloads ready for business cards &amp; badges.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="glass-panel glass-panel-interactive glass-enter delay-4">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Privacy &amp; Accessibility First</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Automatic EXIF metadata stripping on avatars, WCAG AA contrast, and 100% functional even without JavaScript.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/js/landing.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
